A bundle is self-contained: it carries a Raku runtime and every native
library the application loads, so that unpacking it is the whole
installation. That also means it redistributes other people's software.
This file says what is in here, under what licence, and where the
authoritative licence text lives.

Licence texts that ship inside the bundle are in this directory
(`LICENSES/`). Everything else is named with its upstream project, whose
own distribution carries the full text.

