> **Note on the FFmpeg family.** notcurses links FFmpeg for image and
> video rendering, and this pack's FFmpeg is built with `libx264` and
> `libx265`. Those encoders are GPL-2.0-or-later, which makes the FFmpeg
> libraries here GPL-licensed builds rather than the LGPL ones FFmpeg
> ships by default. Redistributing this bundle therefore carries GPL
> obligations for those files. If that is not wanted, the fix is
> upstream in Notcurses-Native's pack (an FFmpeg built without the GPL
> encoders), not here.
